  "input": "Which version is search-indexer pinned to, and until when?\n[2025-08-27] standup/cinder/2025-08-27: The search indexer is pinned to OpenSearch 2.11; the pin lifts when the full reindex completes. Cinder sits on the third floor. [2025-12-17] standup/dune/2025-12-17: Decided in today's standup: search-indexer will rebuild the index nightly instead of on every catalog write, since incremental updates left stale entries behind after failed writes. [2025-12-08] handover/2025-12-08-search-indexer: From today the pager for the indexer rings Dune, not the Cinder team. Ownership transferred.",
